┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── XRPL Camp ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Welcome to XRPL Camp                                                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│ Six steps, about ten minutes. You'll make an account, fund it,                                                                          │
│ write a permanent public sentence, and check that the ledger                                                                            │
│ kept it — then walk out with a certificate anyone can verify.                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│ No real money. No sign-ups. Just you and the ledger.                                                                                    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── XRPL Camp ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Lesson 1: The Mental Model                                                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│ The XRP Ledger is a public notebook. Every few seconds the whole                                                                        │
│ network agrees on the next page and closes it, forever.                                                                                 │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│   Account     — your identity on it: an address anyone can look up                                                                      │
│   Balance     — what it holds, in drops (1 XRP = 1,000,000 drops)                                                                       │
│   Transaction — one line in the notebook, which cannot be erased                                                                        │
│   Memo        — a note you attach to a transaction. Anything you like.                                                                  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  Right now it is on page 21,728,368, closed a moment ago.
  Watching... asked again.

  Page 21,728,369. 1 more closed while you watched — with or without you.

  ✓ Foundation set. It is already running. You are about to join it.
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── XRPL Camp ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Lesson 2: Create a Wallet                                                                                                               │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│ A wallet is a pair of keys:                                                                                                             │
│   Address — your public identity (safe to share)                                                                                        │
│   Seed    — your private key (never share this)                                                                                         │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│ The seed proves you own the address, so anyone holding it can                                                                           │
│ spend your funds. It stays on this machine; XRPL Camp never                                                                             │
│ sends it anywhere.                                                                                                                      │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  Creating wallet... done.

  Address: rJ7MtkCH6EUE8K7p49fDpQzZgSibQXxVA9
  Seed saved to .xrpl-camp/wallet.json

  This is a Testnet wallet. Never use Testnet seeds on Mainnet.

  ✓ Identity created. Nobody issued it to you — you generated it yourself.
  Endpoint: https://s.altnet.rippletest.net:51234/
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── XRPL Camp ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Lesson 3: Fund Your Wallet                                                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│ The XRPL Testnet has a faucet that gives free test XRP.                                                                                 │
│ This is play money — no real value, nothing at risk.                                                                                    │
│ But it behaves exactly like real XRP on the ledger.                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│ Usually about ten seconds, and up to a minute when the faucet is                                                                        │
│ busy — a whole room asking it at once will do that.                                                                                     │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  Funding your wallet from the Testnet faucet... (usually about ten seconds) done.

  Balance:   100.00 XRP (100,000,000 drops)
  Spendable: 99.00 XRP — the other 1.00 is the reserve, locked for as long as the account exists. The ledger charges rent for the space you
take up.

  ✓ Account funded. The network knows you exist now.
  Endpoint: https://s.altnet.rippletest.net:51234/
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── XRPL Camp ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Lesson 4: Send a Payment                                                                                                                │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│ You're about to write something permanent on a public ledger.                                                                           │
│ The payment goes to a second wallet you also own — your mailbox —                                                                       │
│ so both ends of it are yours.                                                                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│ What matters is the memo: your message on the blockchain.                                                                               │
│ It can be anything: your name, a date, a thought, a joke.                                                                               │
│ Once submitted, anyone can read it and nobody can erase it.                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│ Don't paste anything secret. This is public, forever.                                                                                   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  Checking your mailbox account rG9Pqp9eQowueYurXGowYb2SGJv8xx7kGb — does it exist on the ledger yet?
  It doesn't. Asking the network what the base reserve is, so we send enough to bring it into existence...
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── XRPL Camp ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Lesson 4: Send a Payment                                                                                                                │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│ You're sending a real transaction to your mailbox — a second wallet                                                                     │
│ whose keys are also yours.                                                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│   Memo:    recheck 142-1abab5a s                                                                                                        │
│   Encoded: 7265636865636b203134322d316162616235612073                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│   Your memo is converted to hex bytes for the ledger.                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│   To:      rG9Pqp9eQowueYurXGowYb2SGJv8xx7kGb                                                                                           │
│   Amount:  1,000,000 drops (1.000000 XRP)                                                                                               │
│   Fee:     a few drops, set by the network — and destroyed, not paid to anyone                                                          │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│   This one brings that account into existence, so it has to                                                                             │
│   carry at least the network's base reserve.                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                                         │
│ The amount is small on purpose: the point is the memo, not the value.                                                                   │
│ The fee is not our charge, and it does not go to a miner or a validator                                                                 │
│ either — that XRP simply stops existing. Nobody profits from your                                                                       │
│ transaction; it just makes XRP very slightly scarcer.                                                                                   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  Submitting transaction... (waiting for validators to agree — usually a few seconds)

